    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d343">

                <pb facs="0799" n="757" sameAs="frus:frus1951v04p1/pg757"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">No. 343</seg>
                </opener>
                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.5/8–751: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Norway (Bay) to the Secretary of State
                        </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d343-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Oslo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-08-07T16:00:00+01:00">August 7, 1951—4
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>143. I discussed with FonMin today visit to Nor of technical reps Def and State
                    as requested Deptel 104 Aug 1<anchor n="2" xml:id="d343-f2"/> rptd London Todep
                    66 and Paris as intel Aug 2, 8 a.m. FonMin stated that govt prepared receive
                    team but that he will have to discuss time with DefMin. Most Mins now returning
                    from vacation, with PriMin scheduled return Aug 19. He will let us know Nor Govt
                    preference as to time but indicated possibly week of Aug 20.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bay</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d343-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d343-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated to London for Spofford and to Paris for MacArthur.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d343-f2" n="2" xml:id="d343-f2-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
